FAST-LIO: take the map_save request as Request::SharedPtr, for Foxy.

Foxy's rclcpp only binds service callbacks of (Request::SharedPtr, Response::SharedPtr): the
ConstSharedPtr request does not compile there (no matching AnyServiceCallback::set), which
stops the build on the Go2 EDU's Jetson (Ubuntu 20.04). Humble takes both.

diff --git a/src/laserMapping.cpp b/src/laserMapping.cpp
